{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【C108】TERBIS展位Cosplay照片報導！韓國演出陣營也相當出色</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5a4eb0417b789ec1f6c11916b4bef73a925551747e4a1707f4038f078bad926a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7c0b2b6783bf08ff10dab604acdb2751.jpg\"/><p>2026年8月15日(六)、16日(日)舉行中的「 Comic Market108 」 為大家帶來「 TERBIS (以下稱TERBIS)」展位的現場實況！</p><h3>「TERBIS」展位Cosplay照片報導！</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3a66bd3bd65238ef438f0459ef33292491b5286fca20b5d879d4ebae4fad4c61/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F06764fb3dd0e3194b12d99a2c96d8574.jpg\"/><p>本次已是第五次參展的「TERBIS( @Terbis_official )」展位正於 東京國際展示場西4號展廳1331號 參展。 一如往常，Cosplay舞台前方依然熱鬧非凡！</p><p>TERBIS / DyangYi</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b1ad3aaaa9f3c73b21f82aaff7ca63e153cefb79b6ec2306471ab3332b20b0fc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8560a6cba1693e24f7873f8d709d3676.jpg\"/><p>X: @DyangYi</p><p>Instagram: @dyang.yi</p><p>伊莎貝爾 / well</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0502b3a89c59689cb32c25b5ab5cc0526b8a2725b426f5dfc63881e88961ab16/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F09241f680457aa8e9d7e3c6f76ef445d.jpg\"/><p>X: @well__31</p><p>Instagram: @well__31</p><p>塞西莉亞 / AZA MIYUKO</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cb2073debd222977c820198319535f71aa7ab736c386a2db743f386d1f072fd2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7edbc1aa7d2e2c14da6af1b2dc580130.jpg\"/><p>X: @azamiyuko_cos</p><p>Instagram: @aza_miyuko</p><p>奧黛麗 / SolMaeng</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e66e95e0d7afb3668605ebf68c32a9fc59f4f11f0a4b215e025d513097395bbc/lightyear_networkapi/resizef